      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "结果",
          "steps": [
            "在 $z=1/2$ 处：留数 $=\\dfrac{\\sin(\\pi/2)}{2(1/2-3/4)}=\\dfrac{1}{2\\cdot(-1/4)}=-2$",
            "在 $z=3/4$ 处：留数 $=\\dfrac{\\sin(3\\pi/4)}{2\\cdot3/4-1}=\\dfrac{\\sqrt2/2}{1/2}=\\sqrt2$",
